[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Which Glasses?]
[00:00.50]Lesson 23 | 第23课
[00:02.51]Which glasses? | 哪几副眼镜？
[00:05.16]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.06]Which glasses does the man want? | 那个男人想要哪几副眼镜？
[00:16.16]Give me some glasses please, Jane. | 简，请给我几副眼镜。
[00:20.87]Which glasses? | 哪几副眼镜？
[00:22.96]These glasses? | 是这几副眼镜吗？
[00:25.38]No, not those. | 不，不是那些。
[00:28.28]The ones on the shelf. | 货架上的那些。
[00:30.98]These? | 是这些吗？
[00:32.62]Yes, please. | 是的，请。
[00:34.70]Here you are. | 给你。
[00:36.68]Thanks. | 谢谢。